    "snapshot": {
      "plain": " Multi-Element Adaptive Auto Rifle\n[Reload] switches between the Arc, Solar, and Void Elements.\nChosen element persists through stow and death. Defaults to Void Element.\n\nGrants 30% [10%] increased damage for 10 seconds upon inflicting or receiving an Elemental Effect that matches the currently selected Element.\n\nDamage Falloff End stops at 0.7x instead of the usual 0.5x for Auto Rifles.\n\nBullets can ricochet up two times from sharper angles.\nBullets that have ricochet at least once deal 100% [35%] increased damage.\n\n↑Catalyst:\nPassively grants +25 Stability and the Light Touch trait.",
